\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Auction contribution and inventory management on each policy\textquotesingle s CLOB trajectory. Top: total economic value is penalized-shortfall reduction; price edge minus fees is ordinary-shortfall reduction. Bottom: mean absolute inventory at opening and clearing, as a percentage of initial inventory. Historical panels average the five tickers equally. Positive contributions favor participation; bars are 95\% intervals. Retrained access is reported separately in Figure \ref {fig:forecast_information}.}}{35}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
